# git worktrees checked out inside the repo. `git add -A` from the root stages
# each one as a GITLINK — a 160000 entry pointing at whatever that branch's HEAD
# happened to be — which compiles, tests and reviews clean while quietly
# committing 23 phantom submodules. It has happened once; this is the guard.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
